    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the underground world of MolEconomy \u2013 a charming, strategic simulation where industrious moles dig deep to build a thriving subterranean society. Start with a pickaxe and a patch of dirt, and evolve into a sprawling economy powered by resource extraction, useful production chains, and clever market moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine valuable resources, refine them into powerful alloys, and craft unique products to trade on the ever-shifting market. Expand your mole colony with vital infrastructure \u2013 from school to train the next generation of genius diggers, to cutting-edge research center that unlocks powerful upgrades and new technologies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're optimizing supply lines or watching your mole citizens grow smarter and more efficient, every tunnel leads to new possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Deep Resource Management \u2013 Extract ores, refine materials, and build intricate production systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 Dynamic Market System \u2013 Prices fluctuate based on supply and demand. Outsmart the market to maximize profits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f Build &amp; Expand \u2013 Construct essential buildings like schools, housing, research labs, and more to scale your economy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Research &amp; Progression \u2013 Unlock new technologies to enhance efficiency, discover new products, and automate your operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e Mole Society Simulation \u2013 Your moles needs you to guide them. Build a balanced, efficient community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you turn a humble colony into a mole-tropolis of industry and innovation?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the underground world of MolEconomy \u2013 a charming, strategic simulation where industrious moles dig deep to build a thriving subterranean society. Start with a pickaxe and a patch of dirt, and evolve into a sprawling economy powered by resource extraction, useful production chains, and clever market moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine valuable resources, refine them into powerful alloys, and craft unique products to trade on the ever-shifting market. Expand your mole colony with vital infrastructure \u2013 from school to train the next generation of genius diggers, to cutting-edge research center that unlocks powerful upgrades and new technologies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're optimizing supply lines or watching your mole citizens grow smarter and more efficient, every tunnel leads to new possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Deep Resource Management \u2013 Extract ores, refine materials, and build intricate production systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 Dynamic Market System \u2013 Prices fluctuate based on supply and demand. Outsmart the market to maximize profits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f Build &amp; Expand \u2013 Construct essential buildings like schools, housing, research labs, and more to scale your economy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Research &amp; Progression \u2013 Unlock new technologies to enhance efficiency, discover new products, and automate your operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e Mole Society Simulation \u2013 Your moles needs you to guide them. Build a balanced, efficient community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you turn a humble colony into a mole-tropolis of industry and innovation?</p>",
